{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2024-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1721088000, "end_date": 1721779199, "month_true_total": 609, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:00:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "170568160", "author": {"steamid": "76561198077757673", "personaname": "Ducky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198077757673/", "num_games_owned": 178, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 251, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 183, "last_played": 1740241953, "avatar": "6464f661cc568b159d9550e0b350eeef961441c8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "什么这个游戏还能挖矿？我以为只能喝酒呢", "timestamp_created": 1721754467, "timestamp_updated": 1721754467, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170559581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198367867447", "personaname": "楠楠旧情", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198367867447/", "num_games_owned": 34, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7198, "last_played": 1723297969, "avatar": "44b65fa70c3df3819aa00d7b9cb13a40ac7cc2dc"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "疯狂射击\n", "timestamp_created": 1721747100, "timestamp_updated": 1721747100, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170559348", "author": {"steamid": "76561198797999280", "personaname": "迟迟没到场", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198797999280/", "num_games_owned": 45, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 3915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3915, "last_played": 1769951898, "avatar": "56007fec0cdb1e2024825a400a13e671ea1159ac"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "⭐⭐⭐\n任务种类多，有挖矿的，有打怪的（但任务类型和怪就那几个，后面怎么打无非就是加强这些怪的数值）人越多越有趣，强烈推荐和朋友一起玩，一起给黑心老板打工", "timestamp_created": 1721746903, "timestamp_updated": 1782297925, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170553829", "author": {"steamid": "76561198335502599", "personaname": "AMaster", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AMasterX/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 29, "playtime_forever": 13176, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 166, "playtime_at_review": 3759, "last_played": 1787023894, "avatar": "c1061e2608d1c7298ba4d891aa76ada7da8b587c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "多尝试大家都推荐的游戏，这能更好的帮助你找到那些好玩的游戏，也许大家推荐的某款游戏并不适合你，但总会找到你喜欢的。只能说大家都推荐的游戏，果然名不虚传。可惜我今年才了解它。\r\n容量很小，玩法丰富，还能组队，要啥自行车。\r\n四个职业设计的真好，把分工合作发挥到了极致。武器设计也各有特色，技能和模组的加入更是把玩法提升了几个数量级，再加上和队友之间的配合，每一次下矿都有不同体验。任务设计有好多种，新手期不会看蓝黄条时最讨厌扫描任务，现在最讨厌地形复杂的任务。\r\n侦察玩到晋升，开始玩钻机了，因为模组给了个蚀泥迸裂和冰气凝棘，导致我好奇去玩了钻机，结果发现这两模组真好用。\r\n一天不挖矿浑身难受。", "timestamp_created": 1721741973, "timestamp_updated": 1721741973, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 16, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.658017396926879883", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170547154", "author": {"steamid": "76561199